sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Requester
    participant Web as React client
    participant API as Flask API
    participant Match as Matching service
    participant DB as SQLite
    actor Recipient
    participant Admin

    Requester->>Web: Review eligible reciprocal match
    Web->>API: POST /api/exchanges
    API->>Match: Re-check ownership and hard eligibility
    Match-->>API: Eligible + score
    API->>DB: Create PENDING request + event
    API->>DB: Create recipient notification
    API-->>Web: 201 exchange PENDING
    Web-->>Requester: "Pending, not an official change"

    Recipient->>Web: Open exchange request
    Web->>API: POST /api/exchanges/{id}/accept
    API->>DB: Conditional PENDING -> ACCEPTED_BY_BOTH
    API->>DB: Add event + notify requester
    API-->>Web: Updated exchange
    Web-->>Recipient: Accepted by both application users

    Admin->>Web: Open admin console
    Web->>API: GET /api/admin/exchanges
    API-->>Web: Redacted exchange summaries
    Admin->>Web: Start simulated authorization
    Web->>API: POST /api/admin/exchanges/{id}/advance
    API->>DB: ACCEPTED_BY_BOTH -> AWAITING_EXTERNAL_AUTHORIZATION
    API->>DB: Event + notifications
    API-->>Web: Updated summary
    Admin->>Web: Complete simulation
    Web->>API: POST advance COMPLETED
    API->>DB: AWAITING_EXTERNAL_AUTHORIZATION -> COMPLETED
    API-->>Web: Terminal simulated state (no railway system contacted)
